<!-- var(subject)="[APTITUDE] Thank you for joining us in Milan – Board of Beneficiaries Meeting" -->
<!-- var(summary)="Aptitude Consortium – Board of Beneficiaries Meeting" -->
<!-- var(hero)="hero_milano_light_800.png" -->
<!-- var(bordercolor)="#00549d" -->



Dear all,

On behalf of the APTITUDE coordination team, I would like to warmly thank you for joining us in Milan on 5–6 October for our second Board of Beneficiaries Meeting.

Bringing together more than **160 participants**, this meeting was a strong demonstration of the commitment and energy of our consortium. We hope that you found these two days as productive and enjoyable as we did, and that they provided a valuable opportunity to review the progress made during our first year, advance discussions on our use cases and strengthen connections across work packages.

A special thank-you goes to **Politecnico di Milano** for welcoming us to the Leonardo Campus and for its invaluable support in organising the meeting.

I would also like to thank all the speakers, Work Package Leaders and partners who shared their work, presented demonstrations and contributed to the discussions throughout the two days.

### 📂 Presentation materials

All presentations shared during the meeting are available here: 

👉 [Access the presentation materials](https://cloud2.digital-identity-wallet.eu/f/407074)

### 📸 Event photos

Photos from the meeting are available here: 

👉 [View the event photos](https://cloud2.digital-identity-wallet.eu/f/407077)

Your feedback is important to us. Should you have any comments or suggestions regarding the meeting, please feel free to share them with the coordination team by contacting **Emilie Ramond at emilie.ramond@wavestone.com**.

Building on the momentum created in Milan, we look forward to continuing our work together and to seeing many of you at the **APTITUDE Launchpad in Brussels on 29–30 October**.

Thank you again for your participation, your contributions and your continued commitment to APTITUDE.

<br/>Warm regards,

